            <expandOthers>false</expandOthers>
            <footer>Shows opportunities with future and past due decision dates. Excludes &quot;Win Submitted&quot; or &quot;Flag for Deletion&quot; status. Program goal of &gt;95% oppty with future decision dates from previous baseline of &lt;75% current.</footer>
            <groupingColumn>User.Core_User_Geo__c</groupingColumn>
